# SWARAJ v2 — Sovereign Workbench for Agentic Reasoning & Auditable Judgement

**Version:** 2.0.0  
**Status:** Pilot-Ready  
**License:** Proprietary (MRPL Internal)

---

## Product Overview

SWARAJ is a self-hosted, air-gapped, multi-model agentic AI workbench for confidential industrial knowledge work. It converts unstructured refinery documents (scanned inspection reports, P&IDs, near-miss logs) into structured office outputs (approval notes, Excel trackers) while maintaining an auditable execution trace and cryptographic evidence of observed network behavior.

**Primary Workflow:**
```
Unstructured Documents → OCR/Retrieval → Agentic Reasoning → Structured Output → Self-Validation → Cryptographic Certificate → Independent Audit
```

**Key Properties:**
- ✅ Runs entirely offline (no cloud APIs, no telemetry)
- ✅ Real Ed25519 cryptographic attestation
- ✅ Zero-egress monitoring with kill-switch
- ✅ RBAC-pruned agent planning (deny-by-default)
- ✅ Reflexive document self-check (max 4 iterations)
- ✅ Hardware-aware routing (GPU/CPU tiers)
- ✅ Fail-closed security model

