## Pilot Limitations

See `docs/PILOT_LIMITATIONS.md` for comprehensive list. Key limitations:

| ID | Limitation | Severity | Workaround |
|----|------------|----------|------------|
| LIM-001 | GPU performance unmeasured in CI | Low | CPU-only fully validated |
| LIM-002 | Flat-file user storage | Low | Suitable for <10 users |
| LIM-003 | Single-node architecture | Medium | Not designed for clustering |
| LIM-004 | Manual model distribution | Low | Operator downloads separately |
| LIM-005 | OCR accuracy varies | Medium | Human review step included |

