## Explicit Non-Goals

SWARAJ is **NOT**:

- ❌ A general-purpose chatbot
- ❌ A cloud service or SaaS platform
- ❌ A replacement for formal cybersecurity audits
- ❌ A regulatory certification authority
- ❌ Claiming that cryptographic attestation proves host was uncompromised

The demonstrated use case is deliberately narrow: converting confidential refinery documents into structured office outputs while maintaining an auditable execution trace.

